Do not add `oo_json_*`.
Do not add `oo_lsp_complete`.
Do not add stdin frame helpers in C. Drive already frames.
Do not grow `lsp/` or `cli/lsp/`.
Do not edit `runtime/` or `oodac/`.
Do not edit dirty `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda`.
Do not call `process_exec` per keystroke.

Python3 in `lsp_emit` is residual. It is not this ship.
Do not replace it in `chs_rt` this wave.

